  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "We need the ability and option to track knees and elbows with additional vive trackers. Possibly through a menu to assign the trackers to each spot or to turn tracking on and off for each section in case you say don't want to use this feature or if you only want the added elbow tracking and not the knees.\n\nIt can only add to the immersion of the game if we can even more accurately control our avatars. I can't even begin to tell you the amount of times my immersion had been broken because I found my elbows bending the wrong way.\n\nNot only that but the best part of a feature like this. We can finally do the funky chicken!",
